### Stop Helper
use stop_agent when helper going wrong way — like you realize approach bad, or human change what they want.

```
// sent helper to redo auth with JWT
create_team({ name: "jwt_redo", members: [{ description: "redo auth with JWT", prompt: "replace session auth with JWT..." }] })
// ... get agent_id: "agent-x7q" ...

// human say: "actually keep session — just fix null thing"
stop_agent({ agent_id: "agent-x7q" })

// keep going with new direction
send_message({ to: "agent-x7q", message: "stop JWT redo. instead fix null thing in src/auth/validate.ts:42..." })
```
